        <mxCell id="erd_penjualan_program_penjualan_program_biaya_is_manual" parent="erd_penjualan_program_penjualan_program_biaya" style="shape=tableRow;horizontal=0;startSize=0;swimlaneHead=0;swimlaneBody=0;fillColor=none;collapsible=0;dropTarget=0;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;top=0;left=0;right=0;bottom=0;" value="" vertex="1"><mxGeometry y="212" width="364" height="26" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="erd_penjualan_program_penjualan_program_biaya_is_manual_k" parent="erd_penjualan_program_penjualan_program_biaya_is_manual" style="shape=partialRectangle;connectable=0;fillColor=none;top=0;left=0;bottom=0;right=0;overflow=hidden;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontStyle=1;fontSize=11;" value="" vertex="1"><mxGeometry width="44" height="26" as="geometry"><mxRectangle width="44" height="26" as="alternateBounds" /></mxGeometry></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="erd_penjualan_program_penjualan_program_biaya_is_manual_n" parent="erd_penjualan_program_penjualan_program_biaya_is_manual" style="shape=partialRectangle;connectable=0;fillColor=none;top=0;left=0;bottom=0;right=0;overflow=hidden;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;spacingLeft=6;" value="is_manual" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="44" width="170" height="26" as="geometry"><mxRectangle width="170" height="26" as="alternateBounds" /></mxGeometry></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="erd_penjualan_program_penjualan_program_biaya_is_manual_t" parent="erd_penjualan_program_penjualan_program_biaya_is_manual" style="shape=partialRectangle;connectable=0;fillColor=none;top=0;left=0;bottom=0;right=0;overflow=hidden;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;spacingLeft=6;fontColor=#666666;fontSize=11;" value="TINYINT(1)" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="214" width="150" height="26" as="geometry"><mxRectangle width="150" height="26" as="alternateBounds" /></mxGeometry></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="erd_penjualan_program_note" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=12;arcSize=4;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=12;" value="&lt;b&gt;Catatan&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Kolom audit tidak digambar (pola &amp; tabel &lt;i&gt;logs&lt;/i&gt; di halaman ERD Activity Log). Nama tabel sengaja berbeda dari &lt;i&gt;tr_penawaran&lt;/i&gt; (modul quotation lama aplikasi).&lt;br&gt;• Saat Master Program Final dipilih, header &amp; semua baris &lt;i&gt;master_program_biaya&lt;/i&gt; &lt;b&gt;disalin&lt;/b&gt;; edit di penjualan tidak mengubah master (PJ-FR-04, PJ-FR-05, PJ-NFR-02). Angka Master Program = As Is (PJ-FR-18).&lt;br&gt;• Public dan B2B memakai kolom yang sama: &lt;i&gt;target_peserta&lt;/i&gt; (default 10), &lt;i&gt;harga_jual_peserta&lt;/i&gt; wajib; &lt;i&gt;jenis&lt;/i&gt; hanya menentukan jalur setelah final. Tanpa diskon untuk sementara.&lt;br&gt;• &lt;i&gt;id_customer&lt;/i&gt; = Company (tabel existing &lt;i&gt;customer&lt;/i&gt;): wajib bila &lt;i&gt;jenis&lt;/i&gt; = b2b, NULL untuk public (PJ-FR-22, draf 8c). &lt;i&gt;skema_harga&lt;/i&gt;, &lt;i&gt;harga_paket&lt;/i&gt;, &lt;i&gt;jumlah_peserta&lt;/i&gt; tetap dihapus (draf 8): detail harga per peserta B2B ada di Sales Order (ditunda).&lt;br&gt;• &lt;i&gt;status&lt;/i&gt;: draft → final, atau batal. Final: Public → Quotation (1 : banyak), B2B → Sales Order (1 : 1) — modul berikutnya; relasinya belum digambar.&lt;br&gt;• &lt;i&gt;closed_by&lt;/i&gt;, &lt;i&gt;closed_date&lt;/i&gt;: diisi saat &lt;b&gt;Close Program&lt;/b&gt; (modul Manage Peserta, MP-FR-03); terisi = Closed, &lt;i&gt;status&lt;/i&gt; tetap final. Program Closed tidak dapat diajukan biaya (PB-FR-20).&lt;br&gt;• Hijau = tabel modul lain (hanya dibaca); biru = tabel baru modul ini." vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1168" y="60" width="464" height="470" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
